fixture dash_carry_turnaround
doc BUILD.md s15 "Turning around never produces a dead frame"; s5 Ground "Turnaround: keeps 60% speed in the new direction": reversing during the dash's carry-over ends it
room test/flat
spawn 400 544
frames 30
input
  0 R dash
  1..8 R
  9..29 L
end
expect
  at 8 state=dash dash_frame=9
  # Frame 9 would be the first carry-over frame: the reversal turns the player at once instead.
  at 9 facing=-1 vx<0 carry=0
end
